  "bodyHash": "58b4cdd3e574e16d",
  "content": "<p>此模組為每個類別添加了約 280 種方塊。（未來將增加更多類別）</p>\n<p><strong>重要提示 - 模組依賴 !!!</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Forge：</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>自 <strong>Minecraft 1.19.4</strong> 起需要<strong>Blackwolf Library</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NeoForge：</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>始終需要 <strong>Blackwolf Library</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Fabric：</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>對於 <strong>Minecraft 1.19.4 至 1.21.4</strong>，需要 <strong>Blackwolf Library – Fabric</strong>。</li>\n<li>從 <strong>Minecraft 1.21.5</strong> 開始，需要 <strong>Blackwolf Library</strong>（不再需要 <em>Blackwolf Library – Fabric</em>）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blackwolf-library\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DjX58no.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></strong></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blackwolf-library-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mxUSBjd.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p>\n<p>目前可用的類別：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">按鈕</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">地毯</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">箱子（自 Minecraft 1.21.10 起適用於 Forge 和 NeoForge）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">門</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">柵欄和大門</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">梯子（自 Minecraft 1.21.5 起適用於 Forge，Minecraft 1.21.8 起適用於 Fabric 和 NeoForge）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">壓力板</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">告示牌（及其對應的牆壁告示牌）（自 Minecraft 1.21.10 起適用於 Forge 和 NeoForge）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">石階</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">垂直石階（自 Minecraft 1.21.4 起適用於 Forge，Minecraft 1.21.8 起適用於 NeoForge）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">階梯</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">活板門</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">牆壁</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>此模組從原版 Minecraft 方塊中提取紋理。因此，您可以像往常一樣使用資源包覆蓋它們。</p>\n<p>兼容所有資源包。</p>\n<p>它兼容：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a></p>\n<p>要創建這些新方塊，您必須首先創建特定類別的<strong>框架</strong>。以下是配方的示例。</p>\n<p>您可以在配方中使用原版遊戲中該類別的任何方塊。（例如：對於門框架，您可以使用木門；對於活板門框架，您可以使用鐵活板門）</p>\n<p>現在您可以使用<strong>框架</strong>搭配您想要其紋理的方塊。以下是一些示例。</p>\n<p>某些方塊會像它們的原版方塊一樣發光。</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>歡迎在您的整合包中使用此模組</strong></em></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>方塊列表</strong></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>部分按鈕</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hd8w2JK.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"386\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;<strong>部分地毯</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mOknSip.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"231\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>所有門</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/u2W1e4L.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"256\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>所有柵欄</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v2qYh8v.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"241\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>所有大門</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SK7qAPi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"224\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>所有壓力板</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NAeli01.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"268\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>部分石階</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EhVZwf1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"169\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>部分階梯</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6tLWFRL.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"238\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>所有活板門</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iTtbTPW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"279\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>所有牆壁</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fNRRoFI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"238\"></p>\n</div>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>框架配方示例</strong></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>按鈕框架</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B2yOVYA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"510\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>地毯框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VcQpm9m.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"517\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>門框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sz0UO2w.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"520\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>柵欄框架和大門框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OGKxalp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"560\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/f67kLQp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>壓力板框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7seZElJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"525\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;<strong>石階框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nG62lua.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"666\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>階梯框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2NHJERI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"523\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>活板門框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8VWtx4y.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"660\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>牆壁框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RS6U7Bp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"667\"></p>\n</div>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>方塊合成示例</strong></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>砂岩按鈕、鑽石塊地毯、黑曜石 cry 門、地獄岩柵欄和淺藍色染色玻璃大門</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lZm3B3J.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"197\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zo9mxQv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"207\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QbRI4mX.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lMWgvfV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"193\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1FJ0Nq4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"197\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>地獄岩壓力板、鑲金黑石石階、鑲金黑石階梯、黑曜石 cry 活板門和地獄岩牆壁</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hMO1FUZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"194\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K6Joh7Q.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"209\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fQXEBdD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"192\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xWrEAVq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"209\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ohE0ve5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"204\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><strong>Strange Door（無紋理）</strong></p>\n<p>這是一種特殊的門，需要特定的合成方法，您可以使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a> 查看。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fblackwolf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/112d23b8-9986-4823-80de-d312484cf8c8.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"170\"></a></p>\n<p>BisectHosting 提供快速、簡單且高質量的服務器託管服務，在全球擁有十多個可用位置，確保低延遲。購買後，服務器已配置完成並準備就緒。憑藉他們 24/7 的支持和快速響應時間，沒有任何問題會阻擋您！</p>\n<p>使用促銷碼 <strong>BLACKWOLF</strong>，在購買他們的任何遊戲服務器時享受首月 25% 折扣。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fblackwolf\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/blackwolf</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><em><strong>歡迎在您的整合包中使用此模組</strong></em></span></p>",
